<title>ITALY: Italian refinery runs fell 1.9 pct in Q1 1997.</title>
<headline>Italian refinery runs fell 1.9 pct in Q1 1997.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian refinery runs fell 1.9 percent to 22.2 million tonnes in the first quarter of 1997, according to trade body Unione Petrolifera.</p>
<p>It said crude refinery runs fell 6.1 percent over the January to March period but that imported semi-finished products rose 60.2 percent. -- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
